		summary = "**Thriller** is a genre of fiction with numerous, often overlapping, subgenres, including crime, [[Horror fiction|horror]], and [[Detective fiction|detective fiction]]. Thrillers are characterized and defined by the moods they elicit, giving their audiences heightened feelings of suspense, excitement, surprise, anticipation and anxiety. This genre is well suited for making thriller films and television programs.",
